    'Atal Pension Yojana',
    'Atal Pension Yojana (APY) is an old age income security scheme for savings account holders in the age group of 18-40 years who are not income-tax payees. The scheme addresses longevity risks among workers in the unorganized sector and encourages voluntary retirement savings.',
